OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over security costs for
OL,4,AChristmas markets
OL,5,
OL,6,FFestive event organisers say they are
OL,7,Ffeeling the pressure of trying to
OL,8,Fafford public safety measures
OL,9,Frecommended by the police.
OL,11,FChristmas markets are one type of event
OL,12,Fwhere security is routinely assessed by
OL,13,Fpolice, and advice can include
OL,14,Fequipment costing tens of thousands of
OL,15,Fpounds.
OL,17,FSamantha Dennis, chair of South Hams
OL,18,FChamber, said organisers had been
OL,19,Fsurprised by costly suggestions from
OL,20,FDevon & Cornwall Police, which she
OL,21,Fsaid, "I know stopped several local
OL,22,Fevents from happening".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
