OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over security costs for
OL,4,AChristmas markets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said it would be
OL,7,Finappropriate to discuss specific
OL,8,Fthreats, but that Christmas markets are
OL,9,F"one of a myriad of public events we
OL,10,Fare notified about throughout the
OL,11,Fyear".
